---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const user = Astro.locals.user;
const features = [
  ['01','FRESHNESS','Know if the repository is active, stale or abandoned.'],
  ['02','CAPABILITIES','Read the repo structure, stack, releases and documented purpose.'],
  ['03','PERMISSIONS','Surface static signals for shell, filesystem, network and secret access.'],
  ['04','EVIDENCE','Show exactly which checks passed, warned or need human review.'],
];
---
<BaseLayout title="PARADOX — Verify AI agents before you use them" description="Discover and statically verify public AI agents and agent repositories. Check freshness, stack, permissions and repository evidence before you run anything." canonical="https://paradox.engineer/">
<main class="home-v3">
  <section class="hero-v3">
    <div class="eyebrow">PARADOX / AGENT INTELLIGENCE</div>
    <h1>Don't trust the<br/><em>README.</em></h1>
    <p class="hero-copy">Discover public AI agents, inspect the repository behind them and get a fast evidence-based view of freshness, capabilities, permissions and risk signals.</p>
    <form class="hero-form" action="/analyze/" method="get"><input name="url" type="url" placeholder="Paste a GitHub repository URL…" required/><button>VERIFY REPO ↗</button></form>
    <div class="hero-links"><a href="/agents/">Explore agents →</a>{user ? <a href="/account/">Open workspace →</a> : <a href="/auth/">Create an account →</a>}</div>
  </section>

  <section class="statement"><div><span>01 / THE PROBLEM</span><h2>Agent discovery is easy.<br/><em>Agent judgment isn't.</em></h2></div><p>PARADOX is built for the moment after you find a promising agent on GitHub: before you install it, before you give it access, before you trust it.</p></section>

  <section class="feature-grid">{features.map(([n,title,copy]) => <article><b>{n}</b><span>{title}</span><p>{copy}</p></article>)}</section>

  <section class="workflow"><div><span>02 / WORKFLOW</span><h2>Discover → inspect →<br/><em>decide.</em></h2></div><div class="steps"><article><b>01</b><strong>Paste a repo</strong><span>Use any public github.com repository URL.</span></article><article><b>02</b><strong>PARADOX inspects</strong><span>Metadata, activity, releases, manifests and sampled source files.</span></article><article><b>03</b><strong>Get the verdict</strong><span>Freshness, static permission signals, checks and limitations.</span></article></div></section>

  <section class="cta"><div><span>03 / START</span><h2>Bring me<br/><em>an agent.</em></h2></div><div><p>We never execute untrusted repositories. The current verifier is static by design.</p><a href="/analyze/">OPEN VERIFIER ↗</a></div></section>
</main>
<style>
.home-v3{max-width:1220px;margin:auto;padding:0 24px 120px}.hero-v3{padding:92px 0 120px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.eyebrow,.statement span,.workflow span,.cta span{font:700 9px 'DM Mono';letter-spacing:.14em;color:var(--accent)}.hero-v3 h1{font:400 clamp(84px,12vw,165px)/.76 'Instrument Serif';letter-spacing:-.06em;margin:25px 0}.hero-v3 h1 em,.statement em,.workflow em,.cta em{color:var(--accent);font-style:italic}.hero-copy{max-width:690px;color:var(--muted);font-size:17px;line-height:1.75}.hero-form{display:flex;max-width:850px;margin-top:30px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--paper)}.hero-form input{flex:1;border:0;background:transparent;padding:18px;font-size:15px;outline:0}.hero-form button{border:0;background:var(--ink);color:white;padding:0 22px;font:700 9px 'DM Mono'}.hero-links{display:flex;gap:22px;margin-top:16px;font:700 9px 'DM Mono'}.hero-links a{text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:4px}.statement,.workflow,.cta{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:70px;padding:105px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.statement h2,.workflow h2,.cta h2{font:400 clamp(52px,6.5vw,90px)/.84 'Instrument Serif';margin:18px 0}.statement>p,.cta p{max-width:480px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.8;font-size:14px;align-self:end}.feature-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.feature-grid article{padding:30px 22px;min-height:220px;border-right:1px solid var(--line)}.feature-grid article:last-child{border-right:0}.feature-grid b{font:700 9px 'DM Mono';color:var(--accent)}.feature-grid span{display:block;margin-top:80px;font:700 10px 'DM Mono';letter-spacing:.1em}.feature-grid p{color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;line-height:1.6}.steps{display:grid;gap:0}.steps article{display:grid;grid-template-columns:42px 150px 1fr;gap:12px;padding:19px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line);align-items:start}.steps b{font:700 9px 'DM Mono';color:var(--accent)}.steps strong{font-size:15px}.steps span{font:11px/1.5 'DM Mono';color:var(--muted)}.cta{border-bottom:0;background:var(--ink);color:white;padding:65px 40px;margin-top:80px}.cta p{color:#babeb8}.cta a{display:inline-block;margin-top:22px;background:#d9ff3f;color:#090b0b;padding:14px 17px;font:700 9px 'DM Mono'}
@media(max-width:760px){.statement,.workflow,.cta{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:28px}.feature-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.feature-grid article{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.hero-form{display:grid}.hero-form button{height:52px}.steps article{grid-template-columns:38px 1fr}.steps span{grid-column:2}.cta{padding:45px 24px}.hero-v3{padding-top:68px}}
</style>
</BaseLayout>
